</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/Organic_Chemistry/Organic_Chemistry_(Morsch_et_al.)/04:_Organic_Compounds_-_Cycloalkanes_and_their_Stereochemistry/4.05:_Conformations_of_Cyclohexane" class="mt-section" id="section_8"><span id="Exercises"></span><h2 id="Exercises-31412">Exercises</h2>

<p class="lt-chem-31412">1) Consider the conformations of cyclohexane: half chair, chair, boat, twist boat. Order them in increasing ring strain in the molecule.</p>

